  "title": "DoIP: Prepare for ISO 13400-2:2019Amd1 and newer versions",
  "description": "This patch allows to parse messages for the upcoming 2019 Amd1 version\nthat uses header version 4. Since the standard is not final yet, more\nchanges to fully support it are (probably) required.\n\nThe patch also to parse unknown versions, if compatible.",
